115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">3.<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">撰写并交付高质量方案文档：技术建议书、可行性研究报告、<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">POC <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">方案、招投标技术应答、客户汇报<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> PPT <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">等<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">4.<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">支持售前交流、技术交流、产品发布、专家讲座等专业活动；联动<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> AR <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">完成商机推进<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">5.<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">跟踪行业趋势（工业<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> AI<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">、大模型、流程行业案例），沉淀行业知识资产与可复用方案模板<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">6.<span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">协同算法、产品、研发团队完成<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> AI <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">模型选型（统计学习<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">深度学习<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">工业大模型）、特征工程方案、数据治理与闭环方案设计<\/span>3.<span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">协助部门领导完成其他项目工作开展<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">任职条件：<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">1.<span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">学历：硕士及以上优先；本科优秀者（高水平论文<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">竞赛<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">项目）亦可<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">2.<span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">专业：控制工程<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">化工<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">计算机<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">人工智能<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">工业自动化<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">数据科学等相关专业<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">3. <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">硬技能（至少满足其中两项）：熟悉至少一种工业控制系统：<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> DCS<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">Hollysys \/ Honeywell \/ ABB \/ Emerson \/ Yokogawa <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">）、<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">PLC<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> Siemens \/ Schneider \/ Mitsubishi <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">）、<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> MES<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> Rockwell \/ Siemens \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">宝信<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">）、<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> SIS<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">、<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> APC<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> Aspen DMCplus \/ Rockwell Pavilion <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">）等；<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">4. <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">了解至少一个流程行业（石化<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">化工<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">电力<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">冶金<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">制药<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">造纸<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">水务）的工艺背景<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">5. <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">熟悉<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> Python \/ SQL<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">；了解<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\"> Pandas \/ Scikit-learn \/ PyTorch \/ <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">工业大模型框架之一<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"line-height: 115%; margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">6. <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">软技能：技术呈现能力强、文档撰写能力强、跨部门沟通协调；能从「工艺语言」与「<\/span><span =\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1a1a1a;\">AI <\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; color: #1a1a1a;\">语言」双向翻译<\/span><\/p>","tags":"0a552c12-c376-7a08-680f-81329c0f7419,30e31353-9da3-5e3f-4071-d5d647e08170,452537c9-7782-32ad-1d90-37b70f1788ac,b14584e7-93d0-2995-40fb-c27306bfee47,d753827b-dbdb-f5ef-58ee-e61268ef82b8","create_name":"","zhize":"","fangxiang":"","tagsList":[{"id":"0a552c12-c376-7a08-680f-81329c0f7419","title":"节假日福利"},{"id":"30e31353-9da3-5e3f-4071-d5d647e08170","title":"六险一金"},{"id":"452537c9-7782-32ad-1d90-37b70f1788ac","title":"上市公司"},{"id":"b14584e7-93d0-2995-40fb-c27306bfee47","title":"上升期，发展空间大"},{"id":"d753827b-dbdb-f5ef-58ee-e61268ef82b8","title":"发展前景广阔"